---
description: SOLID enforcement
alwaysApply: true
---

- S: one module = one responsibility stated in `//!` header.
- O: extend via registry (tag → handler); no edits to closed match arms.
- L: every trait has law property tests (same file as the trait).
- I: ≤ 5 methods per trait. Split if larger.
- D: modules depend on local traits; concrete impls inject at the boundary.
